@startuml command_solution
title Polecenie - rozwiązanie: enkapsulacja zadania

skinparam monochrome true
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

interface ICommand {
    + Execute()
}

class Button {
    - _command: ICommand
    + SetCommand(ICommand)
    + Click()
}

class LightOnCommand {
    - _light: Light
    + Execute()
}

class FanStartCommand {
    - _fan: Fan
    + Execute()
}

class Light {
    + TurnOn()
    + TurnOff()
}

class Fan {
    + Start()
    + Stop()
}

ICommand <|.. LightOnCommand
ICommand <|.. FanStartCommand
Button o--> ICommand : <<uses>>
LightOnCommand --> Light
FanStartCommand --> Fan

note right of Button
  Button zna tylko ICommand.
  Nowy odbiornik = nowe polecenie,
  zero zmian w Button!
end note

@enduml
